{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The heat shrink assortments fit naturally with my wire connectors because they help insulate electrical connections; I would choose the broader assortment for its range of sizes.",
    "J-B Weld fits my previous interest in tape and vinyl cement because it offers another way to make repairs, provided the material and repair call for rigid epoxy."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The battery lugs and threaded valve require particular cable sizes or fittings that my connector and hose clamp purchases do not establish I need.",
    "The grinding discs, cutting wheels, feeler gauge, thermometer, and lubricant serve tasks I have no current reason to undertake, even though they could all be useful repair supplies."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My purchases of repair supplies seem to have been taken as interest in almost any workshop task.",
    "Owning wire connectors or hose clamps seems to have been treated as a reason to want specialized electrical or plumbing parts without knowing whether they fit my work."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "A useful next purchase should support a repair I already have reason to make, such as insulating connections made with my wire connectors.",
    "Exact fit and material suitability matter: a range of tubing sizes is useful, while a fixed-size battery lug or valve needs a specific matching application."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized my practical repair interests but stretched them into specialized tasks and parts I do not currently need."
}"}
